タチが悪いわ ねえ 辛い Lie Lie Lie 否？ おかしいとこ全部 抉り取って
It's a bad habit, hey, painful lie, lie, lie, right? Gouging out all the strange parts

109
00:23:52,228 --> 00:23:55,728
薄情で結構 好きに呼んでいいよ
Heartless is fine, call me whatever you like

110
00:23:55,728 --> 00:24:00,628
トラウマにバイバイしたいのです です でででです
I want to say bye-bye to my trauma, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes

111
00:24:09,028 --> 00:24:17,428
私、甘え上手に成れなかった 可愛げとかが足りなかった 後悔が煩い夜だ
I couldn't become good at being spoiled, I lacked cuteness, a night noisy with regrets

112
00:24:18,228 --> 00:24:25,228
過去は過去だと割り切っちゃえば？ きっといいコトあるさ とか それくらい 百も承知だ ラッタッタ
If you just write off the past as the past? There's bound to be good things and such, I knew that a hundred times over, ra-ta-ta

113
00:24:26,028 --> 00:24:34,228
願う事も 祈る事も 許されないから黒く染めた 元の色も思い出せない
Because wishing and praying aren't allowed, I dyed it black, I can't even remember my original color anymore

114
00:24:34,528 --> 00:24:44,028
絡んだ運命の 糸 糸 糸 糸
Entangled threads of fate, threads, threads, threads, threads

115
00:24:46,028 --> 00:24:51,028
やだ 痛い痛い痛い痛いな 悲劇のヒロイン気取っちゃって もう 嫌 嫌 嫌 嫌 嫌
No, it hurts, it hurts, it hurts, playing the tragic heroine, no more, no, no, no, no, no!

116
00:24:52,028 --> 00:25:01,045
諦めちゃえば？ でも 会いたいたいたいな 思考回路がこんがらがっちゃって 明日またきっと 壊すけどいいの トラウマさえ愛おしいのです です でででです
Just give up? But I want, want, want to see you, my thought circuits got all tangled up, I'll probably break it again tomorrow, but is that okay? Even my trauma is dear to me, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes

117
00:25:01,357 --> 00:25:06,197
夢の中で君と　手を繋いでいるの
In my dreams, I'm holding your hand...

118
00:25:06,197 --> 00:25:08,617
何も知らない　あの頃の二人のままで
Staying just like the two of us who knew nothing back then.

119
00:25:33,663 --> 00:25:40,243
夢の中で君と　手を繋いでいるの
In my dreams, I'm holding your hand

120
00:25:40,563 --> 00:25:45,803
何も知らない　あの頃の二人のままで
Staying just like the two of us who knew nothing back then.

121
00:25:46,383 --> 00:25:51,863
でも解っているよ　すぐに覚めてしまうと
But I know it will wake up and fade away soon.

122
00:25:52,323 --> 00:25:58,703
それならばいっそ　君の手でそっと止め刺して
If so, then gently put an end to it with your own hands.

123
