126
00:26:09,623 --> 00:26:12,883
もう　嫌　嫌　嫌　嫌　嫌！タチが悪いわ
No way, no way, no way, no way, no way! Such a bad disposition.

127
00:26:13,163 --> 00:26:16,583
ねえ　辛い lie, lie, lie 否？おかしいとこ全部　抉り取って
Hey, painful lie, lie, lie—no? Scooping out every single strange part,

128
00:26:16,583 --> 00:26:20,483
薄情で結構　好きに呼んでいいよ
Call me callous if you like, you can call me whatever you want.

129
00:26:20,803 --> 00:26:24,283
トラウマにバイバイしたいのです　です　で・で・で・です
I want to say bye-bye to my trauma, that's right, that's-that's-that's-right!

130
00:26:24,283 --> 00:26:27,603
です　です　で・で・で・です
That's right, that's-that's-that's-right!

131
00:26:53,523 --> 00:26:58,703
世界欺く　揺るぎない正義
