standing against it to untie that bond—
I will save you no matter what, and I won't waver.

143
00:29:14,963 --> 00:29:23,843
隠す真実はどこへ消えた　たとえ世界を敵に回したとしても
Where did the hidden truth vanish?
Even if I made the whole world my enemy,

144
00:29:26,123 --> 00:29:37,483
信じて僕だけ未来も　決して逃げない迷いはないから　シナリオ壊して抗うんだ
Believe only in me, and the future too—
I will never run away, there is no hesitation,
so break the scenario and fight back.

145
00:29:40,243 --> 00:29:43,583
